{"speciesId":549,"names":{"fr":"Fragilady","es":"Lilligant","en":"Lilligant","ja":"ドレディア"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Même les Dresseurs confirmés ont du mal à faire éclore sa belle fleur. Un Pokémon apprécié des célébrités."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Even veteran Trainers face a challenge in getting its beautiful flower to bloom. This Pokémon is popular with celebrities."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"La fleur sur sa tête a des propriétés relaxantes. Elle se fane si on ne s’en occupe pas avec attention."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The fragrance of the garland on its head has a relaxing effect. It withers if a Trainer does not take good care of it."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The fragrance of the garland on its head has a relaxing effect, but taking care of it is very difficult."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The fragrance of the garland on its head has a relaxing effect, but taking care of it is very difficult."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"La fleur sur sa tête a des propriétés relaxantes. Elle se fane si on ne s’en occupe pas avec attention."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"El aroma de la flor de su tocado relaja a cualquiera a su alrededor. Hay que cuidarle mucho para que no se marchite."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The fragrance of the garland on its head has a relaxing effect. It withers if a Trainer does not take good care of it."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"頭の 花飾りの 香りには リラックスさせる 効果が ある。 手入れを 怠けると 枯れてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Même les Dresseurs confirmés ont du mal à faire éclore sa belle fleur. Un Pokémon apprécié des célébrités."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Todos los famosos quieren uno de estos Pokémon. Incluso a los Entrenadores más curtidos les cuesta que florezca."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Even veteran Trainers face a challenge in getting its beautiful flower to bloom. This Pokémon is popular with celebrities."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"美しい 花を 咲かせるのは ベテラントレーナーでも 難しい。 セレブに 人気の ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La fleur sur sa tête a des propriétés relaxantes. Elle se fane si on ne s’en occupe pas avec attention."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"El aroma de la flor de su tocado relaja a cualquiera a su alrededor. Hay que cuidarle mucho para que no se marchite."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The fragrance of the garland on its head has a relaxing effect. It withers if a Trainer does not take good care of it."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"頭の 花飾りの 香りには リラックスさせる 効果が ある。 手入れを 怠けると 枯れてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Même les Dresseurs confirmés ont du mal à faire éclore sa belle fleur. Un Pokémon apprécié des célébrités."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Todos los famosos quieren uno de estos Pokémon. Incluso a los Entrenadores más curtidos les cuesta que florezca."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Even veteran Trainers face a challenge in getting its beautiful flower to bloom. This Pokémon is popular with celebrities."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"美しい 花を 咲かせるのは ベテラントレーナーでも 難しい。 セレブに 人気の ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"La main la plus verte au monde ne saurait faire éclore une fleur de Fragilady aussi belle que celles qui s’épanouissent à l’état sauvage."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Por muchos esfuerzos o dinero que destine la gente para hacerla florecer, siempre es más bella la flor que brota en un ejemplar salvaje."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"No matter how much time and money is spent raising it, its flowers are the most beautiful when they bloom in the wild."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"どんなに 手間と お金を かけても 人の 手で 咲かせるよりも 野生で 咲く 花の ほうが 美しい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Dès lors qu’une Fragilady trouve un compagnon mâle, sa si jolie fleur se dessèche, se flétrit et finit par se faner."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Nada más encontrar un compañero, su bella flor comienza a languidecer y poco a poco se va marchitando sin remedio."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"As soon as it finds a male to be its partner, the beautiful flower on its head darkens, droops, and withers away."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"パートナーとなる ♂が できた 途端に 美しい 花は くすんで しおれ 枯れていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Le parfum de sa fleur calme les nerfs et apaise l’esprit. Il varie légèrement selon la composition de la terre dans laquelle Fragilady a poussé."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"El olor que desprende su flor varía en función de la composición de la tierra en la que crezca. Su aroma calma los nervios y sosiega el alma."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"The fragrance of its flower differs slightly depending on the soil where it grew up. Sniffing the aroma calms your heart and mind."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"育った 土の 成分に よって 花の 香りは 少しずつ 違う。 嗅ぐと 心が 癒され 安らぐ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sa beauté lui confère une grande popularité auprès des autres Pokémon. Si l’on ne prend pas soin de la fleur sur sa tête, elle fane."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Su belleza fascina a otros Pokémon. La flor de la cabeza se marchita enseguida si no se le presta el cuidado necesario."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It’s well liked by other Pokémon because of its beauty. The flower on its head needs constant care, or it will soon wither and rot."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"美しいので 他の ポケモンに 好かれる。 頭の花は 手入れを 怠ると すぐに 腐って 枯れる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"On raconte que même les meilleurs horticulteurs ont énormément de mal à faire éclore sa fleur."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se dice que conseguir que la flor de su cabeza florezca es una empresa titánica incluso para los mejores jardineros."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It’s believed that even first-rate gardeners have a hard time getting the flower on a Lilligant’s head to bloom."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"一流の 園芸家でも 頭の 花を 咲かせるのは 至難の業と 言われている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"L’huile essentielle extraite de sa fleur dégage un parfum exceptionnel, mais elle coûte extrêmement cher."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"El aceite esencial que se extrae de su flor emana un aroma sublime, aunque su precio resulta desorbitado."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Essential oils made from Lilligant flowers have a sublime scent, but they’re also staggeringly expensive."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"花から 作られる 精油は 極上の 香りが するが 目が 飛び出るほど 高価だ。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"I suspect that its well-developed legs are the result of a life spent on mountains covered in deep snow. The scent it exudes from its flower crown heartens those in proximity."}],"varieties":[{"id":549,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"absorb","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-drain","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"leech-seed","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[2